.TH MPVPAPER 1 "2026-10-16" "mpvpaper-dde 0.1.0-4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mpvpaper \- video wallpaper program for Wayland compositors
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mpvpaper
[\fB\-vf\fR] [\fB\-o\fR \fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIOUTPUT\fR \fIVIDEO\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Plays a video as a wallpaper on a Wayland compositor layer shell surface.
Rebuilt unmodified from upstream GhostNaN/mpvpaper (commit fc5ed28) for the
deepin V25 / UOS 25 (Treeland) desktop; normally started through
.BR mpvpaper-wallpaper (1)
instead of by hand.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Verbose output.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-fork
Fork to background.
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-pause
Start paused.
.TP
.BI \-o " OPTIONS"
Options passed to mpv (quote them, e.g.
.BR "\-o 'no keepaspect'" ).
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show usage.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I OUTPUT
Wayland output name (use
.B wayland-info
to list), or
.B *
for all outputs.
.TP
.I VIDEO
Video file or URL to loop.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mpvpaper-wallpaper (1),
.BR mpv (1)
